      "content": "It makes perfect sense that you feel hollow; that numbness is a sign of how much pain you are in. Those feelings of being fake and heavy are real, even if the feeling itself is confusing. Since the standard lines aren't helping, perhaps you could try reaching out to a crisis text line, as sometimes texting feels less scripted. Remember that you deserve to feel real, and there are people who want to listen without judgment.",
